events=[{'date':P,'event':'account_retell_done','source':R+'claims.json','details':'Retell authorized-surface lane finished.\n- about 100 authorized API requests with our own key at about 1/s (limits 30 to 100 per 10 s); no call, number, batch, chat, knowledge base, test run or other billable action;\n- created and read back a synthetic LLM engine, two agents (one deleted), versions v0 published and v1 draft, a conversation flow, a test definition and six contacts; deleted the flow, definition, contacts and the stray agent, kept one VP-SYNTHETIC agent and engine;\n- read the published SDKs (npm and PyPI 6.2.8), MCP server and web client SDK without installing; REA ran on the web client SDK;\n- found that the API and SDK match exactly (109 operations), that CSV import is JWT-only, that a 10-digit Indian number is stored as +1, that API-created agents lack the AI-disclosure preset the dashboard sets, and that Platform Voices look re-listed from MiniMax, Fish and Cartesia.\nOutputs: claims.json (55), manifest.csv, derived tables under data/account-phase/retell/derived. report.md was not written because the subagent harness forbids report files; the report text went back in the lane structured output.'}]
